    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2077" root="بذخ" body-key="b">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذِخَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخٌ</span>; (Msb;) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b>  and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذُخَ</span></b> , (see what follows,)] inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُذُوخٌ</span>; (L;) <i>It</i> (a mountain) <i>was high,</i> or <i>lofty.</i>
(L, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And hence, (Msb,) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذِخَ</span>, (S, Msb,
K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذخٌ</span>; (S, K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span>,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b>  and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذُخَ</span></b> , but the former is the more approved,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذْخٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُذُوخٌ</span>; (L;) (assumed tropical:)  <i>He was,</i> or <i>became,
proud,</i> and <i>lofty,</i> or <i>haughty;</i> (S, Msb, * K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبذّخ</span></b> : (S, K:) (tropical:)  <i>he exalted himself above
others,</i> (L, TA,) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تبذّخ</span></b> , (A,) <i>by his
speech, and his glorying,</i> or <i>boasting.</i> (L, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَانٌ</span>, (tropical:)  <i>He</i> (a
camel) <i>brayed in the most vehement manner,</i> (L,
TA,) <i>and put forth his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِقشِقَة</span> [or <i>faucial bag</i>].
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذَخَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذْخٌ</span>, <i>He split, clave,
rifted, slit,</i> or <i>rent,</i> a thing. (Msb.)

